# Destruct Key Pro — packages installed in the live image.
#
# The Beerus console is pure Python on the standard library, so
# this list is short on purpose: the interpreter, the drive tools
# the engine runs, the live system itself, and a small operator
# toolkit for the spare consoles (copying job documents off the
# machine, inspecting media). Nothing here opens a network
# service; the destruction environment needs no network at all.

# The live system
live-boot
live-config
systemd
systemd-sysv

# Beerus itself
python3

# The tools the engine runs: drive listing, ATA Secure Erase,
# NVMe Sanitize / Format / sanitize status
util-linux
hdparm
nvme-cli

# Operator toolkit for the spare consoles (copying job documents
# off: mount + cp for a USB device, scp for a network drop)
coreutils
less
openssh-client
